Office_Products.reviewText:
I am currently homeschooling my daughter, so we did use a white board and a chalk board. The chalk board we used is actually a chalk board sticker. As I don't want any chalk dust getting into my daughters respiratory system, we rarely use the chalk board (we have white chalk markers only). So, when given an opportunity to purchase this 10-assorted neon color wet erase non-toxic liquid chalk markers, we are so glad to try it out.

Some of my favorite from this chalk markers are:
* they are non-toxic, so they are safe to be used around small children;
* they are odorless, unlike some other markers that gives out strong smell upon using;
* the bright 10 assorted neon colors, allow more space and options for creativity;
* erasable on non-porous surfaces  not limited to chalk board;
* has options of both chisel and bullet tip.

Please take note that for the first time using the chalk marker, you need to shake it, then press the tip a bit longer to let the liquid absorbed into the tip before using. Even though the marker is erasable on white board surfaces, but they don't clean up fully as a regular white-board marker would. I myself prefer cleaning it with paper towel than the white board duster.

This is my honest opinion in exchange of an opportunity to try and review this product. Thank you.
